   "entry": {
    "id": "vg_meat_market",
    "name": "The Lower Meat Market",
    "music": "story_escape",
    "frame": "#0a0b10",
    "skippable": true,
    "once": false,
    "cards": [
     {
      "style": "image",
      "image": "backgrounds/story/meat_market.png",
      "top": "#0a0b10",
      "bottom": "#1e232d",
      "text": "Kaelen runs the Lower Meat Market past boiling rendering cauldrons. Hollow-eyed, grey-veined Spent stand in silent queues with wooden bowls, trading curfew tallies for communion draughts and grey salt. Not one of them looks up.",
      "fade_in_ms": 1200,
      "fade_out_ms": 600,
      "camera": "scroll",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left",
        "move": "enter"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "text",
      "text": "Whistles shriek behind him. Three scourge-bearers in mortuary grey are already on the rooftops, and the smoke over the chimneys is moving the wrong way.",
      "top": "#0a0b10",
      "bottom": "#1e232d",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left",
        "move": "exit"
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "tags": [
     "prologue"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "upsert",
   "kind": "vignettes",
   "world": "sunk_ward",
   "entry": {
    "id": "vg_bridge_cart",
    "name": "The Mortuary Cart",
    "music": "prologue_tension",
    "frame": "#0a0b10",
    "skippable": true,
    "once": false,
    "cards": [
     {
      "style": "image",
      "image": "backgrounds/story/vn_bridge_stage.png",
      "top": "#0a0b10",
      "bottom": "#1e232d",
      "text": "The canal bridge. An iron mortuary cart stands on the span, its shutters chained, and two prisoners rattle inside.",
      "fade_in_ms": 1200,
      "fade_out_ms": 600,
      "camera": "pan",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "vesper",
        "side": "left",
        "move": "enter"
       },
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left",
        "move": "enter"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "vesper",
      "text": "Chain's black iron. Lever it at the hasp and keep your thumbs out of the way.",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "vesper",
        "side": "left"
       },
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "kaelen",
      "text": "Watch crossbow on the far rail. Whoever is in there, they've been in there since the bell.",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "vesper",
        "side": "left"
       },
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "maren",
      "text": "Please. Whatever you are, break it. They have the Scriptorium seals on this cart, and they do not use them for the living.",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "vesper",
        "side": "left"
       },
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left"
       },
       {
        "who": "maren",
        "side": "right"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "hollis",
      "text": "Left your sister in a ward, did you? Mine's in a convoy. Get this lid off and give me back my arbalest.",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "vesper",
        "side": "left"
       },
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left"
       },
       {
        "who": "maren",
        "side": "right"
       },
       {
        "who": "hollis",
        "side": "right"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "text",
      "text": "The hasp gives. Footmen on both banks. The cart's captives climb out swinging.",
      "top": "#0a0b10",
      "bottom": "#1e232d",
      "actors": [
       {
        "who": "vesper",
        "side": "left",
        "move": "exit"
       },
       {
        "who": "kaelen",
        "side": "left",
        "move": "exit"
       },
       {
        "who": "maren",
        "side": "right",
        "move": "exit"
       },
       {
        "who": "hollis",
        "side": "right",
        "move": "exit"
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
